{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/8138c2b7971eab6544f15541ca551e7d.avif?t=1770145946\" width=441 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Human beings are like detectives. They love a mystery. They love going where the mystery pulls them. What we don\u2019t like is a mystery that\u2019s solved completely. It\u2019s a letdown. ...\u00a0For me, I want to solve certain things but leave some room to dream.</i>\u00a0- David Lynch</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourth Time Around</i>\u00a0is an experimental walking simulator in the style <strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</strong>. You play as Henry, <strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</strong>\u00a0suffering fro<strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0</strong>and must navigate a life-threatening home invasion on New Years Eve. Experience <strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0</strong>crucial momen\u00a0<strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0</strong>series of interspersed vignettes, and use what you learn to uncover the truth.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, non-linear presentation of an unsettling and dreamlike story concerning a man living with regrets\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowing original soundtrack and foley inspired by the modal jazz movement of the 1950s and 60s, uncanny demixes of classic folk and Americana samples and idioms, and chilling ambient synth soundscaping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphical elements reminiscent of late 90s and early 2000s horror titles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily stylized dialogue offering clues to piecing together the mysteries of the experience as memories spill into the present day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257350?t=1770145946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257350?t=1770145946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/761255ad9ef118644412bda9553ca834e6d143cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770145946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/761255ad9ef118644412bda9553ca834e6d143cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770145946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This experience includes subject matter that may be sensitive or triggering for some players, including acts of domestic violence, violent acts involving the elderly, depictions of struggles related to mental and physical health, and consumption of legal drugs and alcohol. Pennywhistle Studios has made every effort to meet this sensitive subject matter seriously and at eye level, and to only include depictions of mature content when it is necessary in serving the holistic themes and tone of the experience. "},"demos":[{"appid":3396390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\