r the mysteries of the experience as memories spill into the present day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.poster.avif?t=1770145946\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.webm?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.mp4?t=1770145946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Pennywhistle Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/26d26f76c66896f950f0fac7b3a1b517a1b9ead6/header.jpg?t=1770145946","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.11 El Capitan<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M made within the last decade<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphic